{"question_id": "505af2f5", "question_type": "single-session-preference", "response": "Given your goals (cutting sugar, saving money) and your current base of almond milk + vanilla + honey, a few spins on it:\n\n- **Cinnamon–vanilla oat milk creamer:** swap almond milk for oat or cashew milk (creamier), replace the honey with monk fruit sweetener or stevia, and add cinnamon — nutmeg or cardamom also work.\n- **Spiced cashew creamer:** cashew milk + vanilla + cardamom, lightly sweetened with yacon syrup.\n- **Energy-boost version:** add collagen peptides, protein powder, or MCT oil to either of the above for extra nutrition/energy (helpful for those 3–4 pm slumps).\n\nMaking it in batches at home keeps it cheap, and the lower-sugar sweeteners fit your sugar-reduction goal.", "n_records": 26, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 3107, "completion_tokens": 953, "calls": 2}, "selected": ["self|sugar_reduction_goal", "self|money_saving_goal", "self|homemade_creamer", "self|granola_experimentation", "self|homemade_granola_batch", "self|granola_snacking_habit", "self|afternoon_sweet_cravings", "self|breakfast_skipping", "self|weekly_snack_prep_plan", "self|on_the_go_snack_needs", "assistant|creamer_sweetener_alternatives", "assistant|creamer_spice_additions", "assistant|creamer_milk_alternatives", "assistant|creamer_nutrition_boosters", "assistant|sunday_snack_prep_ideas", "assistant|granola_grain_options", "assistant|granola_variation_cinnamon_apple", "assistant|granola_variation_tropical", "assistant|granola_variation_cocoa_crunch", "assistant|on_the_go_snack_brands", "assistant|on_the_go_snack_ideas", "assistant|craving_hydration_tip", "assistant|craving_sleep_tip", "assistant|craving_meal_regularity_tip", "assistant|breakfast_ideas", "assistant|breakfast_nutrition_guidance"], "digest_bytes": 4187}
{"question_id": "fca70973", "question_type": "single-session-preference", "response": "Based on your interests — thrill rides, unique food, nighttime shows, and especially Halloween events — I'd suggest a **Halloween Horror Nights weekend at Universal Studios Hollywood**. It runs mid-September through early November, so a September or October weekend would be ideal timing.\n\nA few specifics from what we've discussed:\n\n- **VIP Experience Gourmet Buffet**: You were interested in this — it runs roughly $250–$400+ per person and includes savory meats, seafood, vegetarian options, and desserts, plus perks like priority entry, front-of-line access to all mazes, an exclusive VIP lounge, a private tour guide, and a commemorative photo/gift.\n- **Behind-the-Scenes Tour add-on**: About 1 hour, scheduled in the early evening before the event opens, covering the makeup/FX department, maze design and construction, scare zone design, costumes, and backstage areas. Group sizes are limited, so it's an intimate experience.\n- **Other add-ons to consider**: A private meet-and-greet with HHN's creators/designers, and VIP parking near the entrance.\n- **Food worth seeking out**: Flesh-eating zombie fingers (fried chicken with buffalo sauce and blue cheese), graveyard cake pops, mummy hot dogs with spicy mustard, and the Blood of the Vine drink (cranberry, souvenir cup with glow stick). The Terror Tipsy Turvey Lounge also has signature cocktails, small plates, and scareactor mingling.\n\nOne important note: **book the VIP package well in advance** — these sell out quickly, especially during peak Halloween season. You can book online at universalstudioshollywood.com under Tickets > VIP Experiences, or by phone at (818) 622-8477. Also be aware that cancellations or changes may incur fees.\n\nIf you'd rather go later in the year, **Grinchmas** starts in late November with festive decorations, live shows, and themed food — though given your Halloween interest, Horror Nights is the stronger match.", "n_records": 53, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 4213, "completion_tokens": 2481, "calls": 3}, "selected": ["self|theme_parks_recently_visited", "self|theme_park_interests", "self|halloween_event_interest", "self|universal_vip_gourmet_buffet_interest", "self|universal_behind_the_scenes_tour_interest", "assistant|universal_halloween_horror_nights", "assistant|universal_grinchmas", "assistant|universal_flesh_eating_zombie_fingers", "assistant|universal_graveyard_cake_pops", "assistant|universal_mummy_hot_dogs", "assistant|universal_blood_of_the_vine", "assistant|universal_terror_tipsy_turvey_lounge", "assistant|universal_vip_gourmet_buffet_cost", "assistant|universal_vip_gourmet_buffet_contents", "assistant|universal_vip_perks", "assistant|universal_vip_lounge", "assistant|universal_vip_private_tour_guide", "assistant|universal_vip_photo_and_gift", "assistant|universal_vip_addon_behind_the_scenes_tour", "assistant|universal_vip_addon_meet_and_greet", "assistant|universal_vip_addon_parking", "assistant|universal_behind_the_scenes_tour_duration", "assistant|universal_behind_the_scenes_tour_highlights", "assistant|universal_behind_the_scenes_tour_group_size", "assistant|universal_vip_booking_online", "assistant|universal_vip_booking_phone", "assistant|universal_vip_booking_advice", "assistant|universal_vip_cancellation_policy"], "digest_bytes": 4361}
